Expert knowledge of database structure and theory
Expert knowledge of database optimisation and performance tuning
Expert knowledge of database management systems (e.g. Oracle, MySQL)
Expert knowledge of Oracle cluster technology (RAC)
In-depth knowledge of Oracle GoldenGate
Expert knowledge of disaster recovery and database backup procedures
In-depth knowledge of the operating systems (Windows, Linux)
At least 5 years of demonstrable practical experience;
Based in Germany;
Fluent command of oral and written German (level C2 required) and English at a sufficient level;

Private Health Coverage on the Company’s group program;
